<title>UK: C&amp;W shares gain on back of HK Telecom.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W shares gain on back of HK Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British telecoms company Cable and Wireless gained 8-1/2p in early trade to 508-3/4p on Monday, pushed by a strong performance from its principal asset, Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a slightly delayed reaction to Hong Telecom's share price going up so quickly,&quot; said Steve Scruton, analyst at Credit Lyonnais Laing.</p>
</text>
